Changes to be made to disk control boards (by hand)

(Note: don't do this paragraph for MK boards.)
Jumpers for 1-board version (use red wire):
	(not to be installed if this DC is associated with a DM board)
Add:	DE2 : DF2
	DF2 : DH2
	DN1 : DM2
	ES2 : ET1
	EP2 : ER2
	ER2 : ES2

Address jumpers (use red wire):
Add:	J5-1 : J5-2
	J5-3 : J5-4
	J5-5 : J5-6
	J5-7 : J5-8
	J5-9 : J5-10
	J5-11 : J5-12
	J5-13 : J5-14

Timeout Enable jumper (use red wire):
Add:	J5-16 : J5-41 (the adjacent ground pin)

Xbus Power OK jumper (use red wire):
(For DC board)
Add:	B5-3 : B5-4
(For MK board)
Add:	B12-5 : A11-5
